  "description": "BJ Strobes draws every visible personal beacon at intensity 50, so red shows at about a third of green's brightness and blue at about a tenth, and raising intensity alone saturates well below green. Give each colour its own light colour and intensity so red and blue match green at 20 m and 80 m while keeping their hue, and add yellow, orange, purple, and cyan for team identification (modpack issue #1224). Values were measured in-engine on helmet beacons at night. Remove this manifest when BJ Strobes balances its colours. Also fix two script errors logged on every beacon toggle: isNil str _pfh evaluates an undefined handler variable, and private _obj; declares a variable without a value.",
